    "Only Android subscribes AppState focus/blur; web uses real RN-web AppState without an unsupported event adapter. Existing foreground/background/visibility, actor disposal and controller behavior remain.",
    "Originless Google Maps directions intents preserve destination and travel mode and omit forced navigation; an explicit nonempty origin can request navigation, unless navigate:false. All4 travel modes and reviewed/address destinations pass."
